# Seat 2 passes the first 9p, then draws to clear temporary furiten.
# Seat 1 calls an open kan on 5z and adds the replacement 9p to its pon.
# Seat 2 robs 9p. Mahjong Soul reveals owed indicator 7p after kakan, before ron.
# Tenhou reaches ron before revealing 7p. Neither reveals the added kan's indicator.
# Chankan (1) + pinfu (1) + Mahjong Soul dora (1 for 8p) gives 3 han vs 2.
# Closed pinfu ron is 20 + 10 = 30 fu. Nondealer ron is 30 × 2^(han+2) × 4,
# rounded up to 3900 (3840) or 2000 (1920), paid by Seat 1 to Seat 2.

